</p>
<p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Africana</hi></hi> (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le pic boeuf</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the beef-<lb/>
