<p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Ani</hi></hi>. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le bout de petun</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the razor-<lb/>
