liches Nest bauen, mit einander brüten &#xA75B;c.</p>
<p rendition="#indent-1">19. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g">Corvvs</hi></hi>.</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum conuexum cultra-<lb/>
tum, nares mystace tectae; pedes am-<lb/>
bulatorii.</hi>
</p>
<p rendition="#indent-2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Corax</hi></hi>. Der Kolk-Rabe. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le corbeau</hi></hi>.<lb/>
Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the raven</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">C. ater dorso atro cae-<lb/>
rulescente, cauda subrotunda</hi>.</p>
<p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 63.</p>
