<p rendition="#l2em">
<hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Buffon</hi> Vol</hi>. III. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 3.</p>
<p rendition="#indent-2">3. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Frugilegus</hi></hi>. die Saatkrähe, der Ka-<lb/>
