<p rendition="#indent-2">5. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Monedula</hi></hi>. die Dohle. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le choucas.</hi></hi>
<lb/>
Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the jackdaw</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">C. fuscus, occipite<lb/>
