jeay</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the jay</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">C. tectricibus alarum<lb/>
<pb n="165" facs="#f0189" xml:id="pb165_0001"/>
caeruleis, lineis transuersis albis nigrisque,<lb/>
corpore ferrugineo variegato.</hi>
</p>
<p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 55.</p>
