<p rendition="#indent-2">8. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Pica</hi></hi>. die Aelster, Atzel, Aegerste, Hei-<lb/>
ster. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">la pie</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the magpie</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">C</hi>.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">albo nigroque varius, cauda cuneiformi</hi>.</p>
