<p rendition="#indent-1">22. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g">Paradisea</hi></hi>
</hi>. Paradisvogel (<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">manuco-<lb/>
