bus nigris: extimis duabus margine exte-<lb/>
riori albis, capite cristato.</hi>
</p>
<p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 15. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 2.</p>
<p rendition="#l1em">In Deutschland und den benachbarten Ländern.</p>
<p rendition="#indent-1">28. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g">Stvrnvs</hi></hi>
</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum subulatum, an-<lb/>
