<hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Seba</hi> vol</hi>. II. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 25. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 2.</p>
<p rendition="#l1em">Auch in America. Hat gar keine Schuppen,<lb/>
