<p rendition="#indent-2">6. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Fimetarius</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">S. scutellatus, thorace in-<lb/>
ermi, capite tuberculato elytris rubris, cor-<lb/>
