<p rendition="#indent-1">56. <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g">Ichnevmon</hi></hi>
</hi>. Schlupfwespe, Spin-<lb/>
nenstecher. <hi rendition="#aq">Os maxillis absque lingua.<lb/>
